<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36687" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξαμβλ-όω</span></b>  (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξαναβλ</span>- is dub. in <i><span class="en">
			Hsch.
		</span></i>), aor.2
		inf.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-αμβλῶναι</span> prob. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				f.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ῶσαι</span>
			 in <i><span class="en">
				Them.
				<u>Or.</u>
				2.33b
			</span></i>:—<i>make to miscarry,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νηδὺν ἐξαμβλοῦμεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Andr.</u>
					356
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, of the foetus, <i>miscarry,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βρέφος ἐξαμβλωθέν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Apollod.
					3.4.3
				</span></i>
			: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὕτη ἡ ἐλπὶς ἐξήμβλωτο αὐτῇ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ael.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					57
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>make abortive:</i> metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φροντίδ᾽
				ἐξήμβλωκας</span> you <i>have made</i> a notion
				<i>miscarry,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Nu.</u>
				137
			</span></i>; to which Strepsiades retorts, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰπέ
				μοι τὸ πρᾶγμα τοὐξημβλωμένον</span> your <i>abortive
				thought,</i> ib.<i><span class="en">
				139
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Tht.</u>
				150e
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. θείας γονάς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.219
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ πυρὸς ἐξαμβλούμενος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>CP</u>
					4.5.3
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σώματος ἰσχὺς ἐξαμβλοῦται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.2e
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> intr.,
				<i>prove abortive,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				2.25
			</span></i>: impers., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξαμβλοῖ</span>”
				<i>a miscarriage follows,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>HA</u>
					577b6
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
